 fill="#f7dcca" d="M77.92 278.04l22.42 5.24-1.25 11.11-5.66 1.67-15.51-18.02z"></path><path fill="#f4cdb3" d="M96.68 265.36l-12.05-1.88-3.04 2.83 12.36 5.34 2.73-6.29z"></path><path d="M83.79 273.85l-5.87 4.19 3.46 4.09s24.2 5.24 24.2 4.92-.1-3.35-.1-3.35l-21.69-9.85z" fill="#f7dcca"></path><path fill="#f7dcca" d="M87.56 279.72l4.82-9.22-2.93-.42-11.53 7.96 9.64 1.68z"></path><path fill="#f4cdb3" d="M235.77 161.12l8.33-7.56 10.38-13.2 2.51.63-6.29 15.09-5.91 9.16-9.02-4.12z"></path><path fill="#f7dcca" d="M248.5 165.19l13.84-17.29-3.15-1.88-20.74 19.17h10.05z"></path><path fill="#b5cfa8" d="M34.75 278.04l26.41-72.51"></path><path fill="#95ba83" d="M33.808 277.7l26.419-72.507 1.879.685-26.42 72.507z"></path><g><path fill="#b5cfa8" d="M154.2 196.73l-3.77 30.18"></path><path fill="#95ba83" d="M149.448 226.807l3.775-30.174 1.984.248-3.774 30.175z"></path></g><path d="M130.23 84.6c-2.18 0-5.49-.13-10.1-.63l.22-1.99c8.88.97 12.86.51 12.9.5l.25 1.98c-.08.01-1.12.13-3.26.13z" fill="#e7a269"></path></g></g></svg><figure class="UVScene9_overlay__MfUbF"></figure></div></div></div></div><div class="section bg-yellow-30  clip-pad-top-uv-xs"><div class="SectionHeading_inner__zw_y_"><h2 class="SectionHeading_h2__tbZ9L headline-2" id="jetzthandeln">Jetzt handeln!</h2></div></div><div class="section bg-yellow-30 clip-pad-bottom-uv-xs"><div class="Paragraph_inner__LZf66"><div class="Paragraph_paragraph__RBIN1"><p>Das Telefon klingelt endlich. Es ist Lauras Hautarzt. Die Probe ist&nbsp;unbedenklich &ndash; zum Gl&uuml;ck. Laura: &bdquo;Da f&auml;llt mir aber ein Stein vom Herzen!&ldquo;</p>
<p>Das ist nochmal gut gegangen. Aber jetzt wissen wir: Klimawandel und UV-Strahlung sind Ursache f&uuml;r Krankheit und sogar Tod. In den letzten 20 Jahren sind in Deutschland 80.000 Menschen an Hitze gestorben. An UV-bedingtem Hautkrebs verstarben seit 2000 rund 70.000 Menschen.</p></div></div></div><div class="no-print"><div class="UVScene10_wrapper__STM_H"><div class="IllustrationContainer_inner__L4XL2"><div class="IllustrationContainer_illustration__NrdFy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 -15 315.07 290.52" class="UVScene10_people__FHOLG"><g data-name="Ebene 2"><g data-name="S10"><path fill="#463f68" d="M150.11 266.46l1.54 8.09 23.49-11.17-24.64-3.08-.39 6.16z"></path><path fill="#bd8253" d="M217.84 210.85l1.61 127.94 3.21 1.91 2.57-1.91 1.61-128.32-9 .38zM298.83 167.11l1.6 127.94 3.22 1.91 2.57-1.91 1.61-128.32-9 .38zM116.93 121.21l1.61 127.93 3.21 1.91 2.57-1.91 1.61-128.31-9 .38z"></path><path fill="#bd8253" d="M21.86 147.05l97.87-32.28 204.34 52.34v3.35l-93.16 51.66-209.05-75.07z"></path><path fill="#e7a269" d="M21.86 144.4l97.87-33.92 204.34 56.63-93.16 50.1L21.86 144.4z"></path><path fill="#b74d48" d="M54.47 111.62l47.02 37.61-7.39 14.83-48.22-22.14 8.59-30.3z"></path><path fill="#284d71" d="M113.72 248.5l25.94 45.56 13.63-42.24-26.6-14.96-12.97 11.64z"></path><g fill="#918da7"><ellipse cx="77.69" cy="326.25" rx="39.94" ry="22.63"></ellipse><circle cx="40.73" cy="338.53" r="4.91"></circle><ellipse cx="74.51" cy="350.65" rx="2.31" ry="4.91"></ellipse><ellipse cx="111.42" cy="340.55" rx="5.25" ry="4.91"></ellipse><ellipse cx="109.11" cy="316.29" rx="5.25" ry="4.91"></ellipse></g><path fill="#284d71" d="M124.17 216.4l32.1 46.21-7.7 7.7-49.43-45.06 25.03-8.85z"></path><path fill="#625c81" d="M137.74 248.73l-55.86-23.82-68.86 27.29 2.82 8.45 63.95 30.02 55.13-33.42 2.82-8.52z"></path><path fill="#918da7" d="M13.02 252.2L80 282.8l57.74-34.07-55.86-23.82-68.86 27.29z"></path><path fill="#284d71" d="M49.68 234.01l61.74